     In our opinion, three factors largely account for the=20
unusual acceptance of the News in the community.  Among these,=20
points 2 and 3 also may explain the popularity of the Sunday News=20
compared to that of the Sunday Courier-Express when it was the=20
sole Sunday paper:

     (1) The first point has nothing to do with merits of the=20
